<figure class="backend-diagram" aria-label="Spec-driven backend architecture">
  <div class="spec-node">
    <span class="node-label">CAO / TypeSpec contracts</span>
    <strong>HTTP API · Storage schema · Analytics contracts</strong>
  </div>
  <div class="connection" aria-hidden="true"><span>Generate contracts. Implement the backend.</span></div>
  <div class="backend-boundary">
    <div class="boundary-label"><span>Your cloud / Your infrastructure</span><span>Schematic</span></div>
    <div class="backend-node server-node">
      <svg viewBox="0 0 48 32" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 3h38v10H5zM5 19h38v10H5zM10 8h2m4 0h2m-8 16h2m4 0h2M31 8h7m-7 16h7" /></svg>
      <strong>CAO server</strong>
      <span>Go server / Your container platform</span>
      <small>API, authentication, and dashboard queries</small>
    </div>
    <div class="storage-branches">
      <div class="storage-branch">
        <div class="connection" data-edge="server-to-postgres"><span>Read / write</span></div>
        <div class="backend-node">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 48 32" aria-hidden="true"><ellipse cx="24" cy="6" rx="17" ry="4" /><path d="M7 6v20c0 6 34 6 34 0V6M7 16c0 6 34 6 34 0" /></svg>
          <strong>PostgreSQL</strong>
          <span>Managed or self-hosted database</span>
          <small>Canonical evidence + isolated operational state</small>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="storage-branch optional-branch">
        <div class="connection" data-edge="server-to-objects"><span>Opt-in archive</span></div>
        <div class="backend-node optional-node">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 48 32" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 6h38v23H5zM5 12h38M10 2h28v4M14 18h7v6h-7zM27 18h7v6h-7z" /></svg>
          <strong>Object storage</strong>
          <span>Private session archive</span>
          <small>Approved unified sessions as Parquet</small>
        </div>
        <div class="connection query-connection" data-edge="analytics-to-objects"><span>Query approved Parquet</span></div>
        <div class="backend-node optional-node">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 48 32" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 3v26h38M11 23v-6h5v6m6 0V9h5v14m6 0V4h5v19" /></svg>
          <strong>Analytics engine</strong>
          <span>Parquet query engine</span>
          <small>Optional private-archive analytics</small>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
  <figcaption>
    Backend pattern, not automatic provisioning. Object archives and analytics are independently opt-in;
    neither is required for PostgreSQL-backed dashboard queries. Custom providers need compatible adapters.
  </figcaption>
</figure>

